{"id": "finqa_dev_174", "split": "dev", "subset_source": "FinQA", "question": "What percentage of Hologic's total contractual obligations, as outlined in the table for September 27, 2008, are due for payment within the next 12 months?", "program_answer": 0.05793160658263424, "original_answer": "5.8%", "company_cik": 859737, "report_year": 2008, "gold_chunk_ids": [53], "final_answer": "According to Hologic's contractual obligations table as of September 27, 2008:\n\n* **Obligations due in less than 1 year (next 12 months):** $156,571 thousand\n* **Total contractual obligations:** $2,702,687 thousand\n\n$$\\text{Percentage} = \\frac{\\$156,571}{\\$2,702,687} \\times 100 \\approx 5.79\\%$$\n\nApproximately **5.79%** of Hologic's total contractual obligations were due for payment within the next 12 months.", "iterations": 4, "hit_iteration_cap": true, "judge_verdicts": ["loop", "loop", "loop", "finish"], "trajectory": [{"iteration": 1, "query": "Hologic contractual obligations table September 27 2008 less than 1 year total", "rerank_query": "contractual obligations table September 27 2008 less than 1 year total", "tickers": ["HOLX"], "judge_verdict": "loop", "top_k": [["HOLX_2008_859737", 52, 0.9905926585197449], ["HOLX_2007_859737", 49, 0.8757919073104858], ["HOLX_2009_859737", 106, 0.8702230453491211], ["HOLX_2010_859737", 52, 0.7011144757270813], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 113, 0.6606952548027039], ["HOLX_2003_859737", 22, 0.6592079401016235], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 58, 0.6426136493682861], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 61, 0.5920255780220032], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 112, 0.5407059788703918], ["HOLX_2009_859737", 62, 0.5164071321487427]], "candidates_prerank": [["HOLX_2008_859737", 132], ["HOLX_2010_859737", 66], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 113], ["HOLX_2010_859737", 71], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 61], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 68], ["HOLX_2009_859737", 62], ["HOLX_2015_859737", 90], ["HOLX_2009_859737", 67], ["HOLX_2009_859737", 72], ["HOLX_2015_859737", 88], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 112], ["HOLX_2011_859